{"seq":1,"slug":"wms-location-task-data-model","title":"WMS 库位主数据与任务模型：定向上架指令与任务队列集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-slotting-directed-putaway-replenishment/slotting-ops-labor-wms/wms-location-task-data-model","wordCount":3803,"readingTime":16,"html":"<h1 id=\"wms-库位主数据与任务模型-定向上架指令与任务队列集成\">WMS 库位主数据与任务模型：定向上架指令与任务队列集成</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-库位主数据-任务与指令的三层模型\">核心概念：库位主数据、任务与指令的三层模型</h2><p>Slotting 的所有策略——库位分配算法、ABC 分级、补货触发——最终都必须落到 WMS 里三个互相依赖的数据对象上：**库位主数据（location master data）**描述&quot;货能放哪&quot;，**任务（task / work item）**描述&quot;某个人在某时刻要做的一件事&quot;，**指令（instruction）**描述&quot;这件事的目标库位与数量由谁决定&quot;。很多人把三者混成一件事，结果系统能算出理想库位却下不出可执行指令，或者指令下发了却因主数据缺字段而卡在&quot;目标库位不可用&quot;。</p>\n<p>三层的边界很清晰：主数据是<strong>慢变量</strong>，改动一次影响未来几个月的作业，由工程/IE 团队维护；任务是<strong>快变量</strong>，分钟级生灭，旺季可达每小时数千条；指令是<strong>决策函数</strong>，把订单/收货/补货信号映射到具体的 (SKU, 源库位, 目标库位, 数量, 作业人)。定向上架（directed putaway）的本质就是把这个决策函数从人工经验搬进系统，让 WMS 在收货确认瞬间算出目标库位并派单。</p>\n<p>跨境仓把复杂度又抬了一档：一批到货可能同时含平台自营爆款（立即进拣货面）、长尾卖家直发品（进储备区）、需质检/贴标的在途货（进暂存位）。三层模型若没有显式字段承载这些差异，作业员就只能靠纸单和经验兜底——这是 slotting 项目最常见的&quot;算法做对了但落地失败&quot;的原因。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[上游信号&lt;br/&gt;ASN / 补货触发 / 拣货确认] --&gt; B[指令生成器&lt;br/&gt;定向上架路由]&#10;    B --&gt; C{主数据可选性检查&lt;br/&gt;容积/载重/温区/混放}&#10;    C --&gt;|不满足| D[候选库位重排]&#10;    D --&gt; B&#10;    C --&gt;|满足| E[生成任务对象&lt;br/&gt;源→目标 + 数量 + 优先级]&#10;    E --&gt; F[任务队列&lt;br/&gt;按优先级/巷道/资质分区]&#10;    F --&gt; G[派单到手持终端 / AMR / 语音]&#10;    G --&gt; H[执行与扫描确认]&#10;    H --&gt; I[库存事务落库&lt;br/&gt;源减目标增]&#10;    I --&gt; J[主数据占用状态更新]&#10;    J --&gt; A\">graph TD\n    A[上游信号&lt;br/&gt;ASN / 补货触发 / 拣货确认] --&gt; B[指令生成器&lt;br/&gt;定向上架路由]\n    B --&gt; C{主数据可选性检查&lt;br/&gt;容积/载重/温区/混放}\n    C --&gt;|不满足| D[候选库位重排]\n    D --&gt; B\n    C --&gt;|满足| E[生成任务对象&lt;br/&gt;源→目标 + 数量 + 优先级]\n    E --&gt; F[任务队列&lt;br/&gt;按优先级/巷道/资质分区]\n    F --&gt; G[派单到手持终端 / AMR / 语音]\n    G --&gt; H[执行与扫描确认]\n    H --&gt; I[库存事务落库&lt;br/&gt;源减目标增]\n    I --&gt; J[主数据占用状态更新]\n    J --&gt; A</pre><p>三层之间靠<strong>库存事务（inventory transaction）<strong>闭合：只有执行确认（scan confirm）才产生库存变动，主数据占用状态、任务状态、ERP 账务库存必须以同一条事务为准。这是 WMS 与 ERP 分工的铁律——WMS 拥有</strong>物理库位级</strong>实时账，ERP 拥有<strong>财务口径</strong>汇总账，两者通过事务接口对齐而非互相覆盖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"库位主数据的字段模型与层级\">库位主数据的字段模型与层级</h2><p>库位主数据的粒度决定了定向算法能算出多细的指令。最通用的编码是四段式&quot;巷道-货架-层-格&quot;（aisle-rack-level-bin），不同厂商叫法不同但语义一致。GS1 的物流标签体系（GS1 General Specifications，SSCC 用应用标识符 AI 00）解决的是&quot;货&quot;的全球唯一标识，而库位标识是<strong>仓内私有编码</strong>——同一批货在全球有唯一 GTIN/SSCC，它在仓内的落脚点却只是本地编号，这是新手最容易搞混的一点。</p>\n<p>一个可支撑定向上架与补货触发的库位主数据，至少要覆盖下表四类字段。缺任何一类，指令生成都会退化成&quot;随机挑一个空位&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段类别</th>\n<th>典型字段</th>\n<th>为什么定向算法需要它</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>结构定位</td>\n<td>库位编码、区（zone）、巷道、货架、层、格、坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x,y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>计算行走距离、连通性、作业顺序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物理约束</td>\n<td>容积、载重上限、开口尺寸、是否可叠放、温区、危险品许可</td>\n<td>候选库位过滤，防止放不进或结构风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用途属性</td>\n<td>拣货面/储备区/暂存区/质检位/退货位、拣货方式、是否允许混放</td>\n<td>决定该位能否承接某类 SKU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态属性</td>\n<td>空/占用/锁定/盘点中/维修中、当前 SKU、当前数量、占用率</td>\n<td>实时可用性、避免与在途任务冲突</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>区（zone）与巷道（aisle）的层级不是装饰：<strong>ABC 分级与行走距离计算都在这个层级上聚合</strong>，拣货面容量按区统计，补货路由的顺路判定按巷道顺序比较。若主数据只有扁平库位号，算法就只能靠坐标硬算，且难以做&quot;整巷道封控&quot;这类运维操作。同 hub 的 <a href=\"../directed-putaway-replenishment/replenishment-trigger-signal-model\">补货触发信号模型</a> 里拣货面的 max 上界直接来自槽位容积与载重，这两个量就是本节的物理约束字段。</p>\n<p>跨境仓还要额外承载<strong>合规属性</strong>：某库位是否有保税监管资质、是否属于退货暂存区、是否需单独温控。这些是指令生成时的硬过滤条件而非软偏好——算法就算算出&quot;放这里最短路径&quot;，只要该位无保税资质，指令就不能下发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"定向上架指令的生成-从入库单到目标库位\">定向上架指令的生成：从入库单到目标库位</h2><p>定向上架指令的生成可以拆成&quot;候选集生成—评分排序—派单&quot;三步。候选集的生成是<strong>硬约束过滤</strong>：容积够、载重够、温区一致、用途匹配（该 SKU 的 ABC 级别对应的位类型）、状态为空或可混放、且未被其他在途任务锁定。这一步通常能砍掉 95% 以上的库位，剩下的是评分排序能处理的候选。</p>\n<p>评分排序是对剩余候选打一个综合分，取最高者作为目标库位。一个典型的形式是加权和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Score}(l) = w_v \\cdot V(l) + w_d \\cdot \\left(1 - \\frac{d_l}{d_{\\max}}\\right) + w_c \\cdot C(l) - w_p \\cdot P(l)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(l)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是该库位与 SKU 流速等级的匹配度（爆款进黄金拣货位得分高），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是收货口到该库位的行走距离，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(l)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是容量利用率/聚集度（鼓励同 SKU 集中、空间填满，减少碎片空位），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(l)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是冲突惩罚（与在途任务抢占同一格位、与即将到货的预占需求冲突）。权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_v, w_d, w_c, w_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是仓库级调参旋钮：越靠近发货口的仓越该抬高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；SKU 长尾且换季频繁的仓应压低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 以保留弹性。这三个权重不能拍脑袋——它们必须与库位分配算法的目标函数同源，否则重设计的成果会被日常上架在几周内&quot;抹平&quot;，这正是 <a href=\"../slotting-strategy-models/slotting-redesign-cutover-migration\">库位重设计与迁移切换</a> 里收敛问题在日常作业上的放大器。</p>\n<p>派单环节把 (SKU, 源库位, 目标库位, 数量) 打包成任务对象：源库位通常是收货暂存位或月台，目标库位是评分选出的位。任务生成后立即在目标库位上加&quot;软锁（soft lock）&quot;，防止第二个并发任务把同一格位也选走——收货回执在几秒内批量到达时，两个指令可能同时读到&quot;该位为空&quot;，这是并发下最容易被忽略的竞态。</p>\n<p>上架指令还必须回答<strong>放多少</strong>。一批货超出单个库位容量时要拆成多个任务（拆分上架），每个任务指向不同库位，且拆分后的选择仍要考虑&quot;同 SKU 尽可能聚集&quot;——否则同一 SKU 会被撒到四五个巷道，拣货反而更慢。拆分边界由整箱包装数与托盘层数决定，与补货侧的取整逻辑对称。</p>\n<h2 id=\"任务队列-优先级-插单与任务交叉\">任务队列：优先级、插单与任务交叉</h2><p>任务队列是 WMS 里最像&quot;操作系统调度器&quot;的部件。它同时装着上架、补货、拣货、移库、盘点五类任务，而作业员、AGV、叉车是共享资源。队列设计要解决三个问题：<strong>排序</strong>（先做谁）、<strong>分区</strong>（谁来做）、<strong>交叉</strong>（一次行走能不能干两件事）。</p>\n<p>排序优先级通常由若干分量加权：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = \\alpha \\cdot U + \\beta \\cdot S - \\gamma \\cdot A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 是紧急度（是否卡住下游：拣货面断供的补货、月台超时未上架的到货），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是省力收益（顺路、批量、减少空驶），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 是已等待时长（防饿死）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的权重太低，低优先任务在旺季会被无限推迟，主数据里就会出现&quot;明明有货却找不到&quot;的幽灵库存。</p>\n<p>**任务交叉（task interleaving）**是队列设计的高价值项——把两件方向相反的任务配成一次行走：拣货员把货送到发货口后顺路从储备区带一份补货到拣货面，叉车送回空托盘时顺带执行一次上架。De Koster、Le-Duc 与 Roodbergen 在 <em>European Journal of Operational Research</em>（2007, 182(2): 481–501）的仓库拣货综述中，把作业协同列为影响效率的关键设计维度。工程上必须把&quot;一次行走能否覆盖两个任务&quot;表达成主数据里可计算的距离/顺序关系，否则交叉只能靠调度员直觉。</p>\n<p><strong>插单（hot task）<strong>是队列的另一种压力：旺季大促订单、超时补货、异常退货需要立刻打断在队任务。正确做法是</strong>抢占优先级而非抢占物理执行</strong>——提高该任务的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 让它跳到队首，而不是强行中断已在巷道里走了一半的作业员；强行中断会造成&quot;半成品位置&quot;，主数据里出现难以对账的中间状态。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>队列机制</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n<th>主要陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>优先级排序</td>\n<td>资源分配到正确的事</td>\n<td>权重失衡导致长尾任务饿死</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分区（按巷道/温区/资质）</td>\n<td>减少跨区无效行走</td>\n<td>分区过细导致某些区人力闲置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任务交叉</td>\n<td>减少空驶、缩短行走</td>\n<td>组合失败时反而增加等待</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>插单/热任务</td>\n<td>应对突发与 SLA 超时</td>\n<td>抢占物理执行产生半成品状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批量派单（wave / cluster）</td>\n<td>摊薄单次行走固定成本</td>\n<td>波次过大导致波次间断供</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>跨境仓的队列还多一层<strong>合规优先级</strong>：涉及海关查验、保税核放的库位变更不能与其他任务合并到同一次行走，必须保持审计链完整；这类&quot;不可合并&quot;标记同样要落在主数据上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与补货任务的同队列集成\">与补货任务的同队列集成</h2><p>上架与补货共用一条队列，是因为它们在同一物理空间争夺同一批资源、共享同一份主数据。集成方式有两种：<strong>统一任务池</strong>把所有任务生成同构对象（源、目标、SKU、数量、类型、优先级），用同一套优先级公式排序，资源利用率最高、任务交叉最容易实现，但需要给每类任务标定可比的优先级尺度，否则会出现&quot;上架永远排在补货前面&quot;的系统性偏斜；<strong>分池 + 共享层</strong>按类型分池、在派单层统一裁决，各池可用各自合适的排序逻辑，但任务交叉必须在裁决层显式实现。</p>\n<p>无论哪种方式，集成正确性的判据只有一个：<strong>同一条库存事务链上，源库位减与目标库位加必须原子成对，任务状态与主数据占用状态必须一致</strong>。上架任务的库位选择会改变补货员熟悉的&quot;货在哪&quot;，因此上架指令日志（谁、何时、把什么放到哪）必须可追溯——补货员反馈&quot;找不到货&quot;时，系统要立刻回答这是&quot;上架放错&quot;还是&quot;有人误移&quot;。这是定向上架从&quot;更快&quot;变成&quot;更可信&quot;的关键，也是很多仓在全面自动化之前先强制上架扫描确认（scan-to-confirm）的原因。</p>\n<p>跨境场景还要考虑<strong>暂存位的双向流动</strong>：退货、质检、改标让货在主库位与暂存位之间来回移动，这类任务既不是上架也不是补货，但同样占用队列。把它们显式建模成一类任务（而非塞进&quot;移库&quot;大杂烩），才能让 slotting 的库位占用率统计不被暂存流量污染。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程现实-接口-并发与-2026-年的架构取向\">工程现实：接口、并发与 2026 年的架构取向</h2><p><strong>接口标准化</strong>。设备侧，VDA 5050（德国汽车工业协会发布的 AGV/AMR 与主控系统通信接口，已有 2.x 版本）成为移动机器人接入的通用协议，WMS 通过主控下发任务对象而非各私有协议。上游侧，收货由 ASN（如 EDI X12 856 / EDIFACT DESADV）触发，上架指令候选集在货到之前就能预生成，把指令生成从&quot;收货时&quot;提前到&quot;在途时&quot;。事件侧，GS1 EPCIS 2.0（2022 年成为 GS1 标准）定义供应链事件的捕获与共享模型，跨境仓用它把上架/补货/出货事件与外部伙伴对齐。SAP EWM 这类主流 WMS 把任务对象落在独立任务表中、与库存事务分离，正是本文三层模型在商业系统里的体现。</p>\n<p><strong>并发正确性</strong>。竞态都源于&quot;读到空位&quot;与&quot;占用该位&quot;之间的窗口：回执批量到达、多台 AGV 同时选位、补货与上架抢同一格位。工程解法是<strong>库位级软锁 + 乐观并发控制</strong>——任务生成时对目标位加锁并写入预期版本号，提交时校验版本，冲突则让指令生成器重排候选（上图的&quot;候选库位重排&quot;回路）。不做这一层，主数据里会出现两个 SKU 声称占用同一格位的脏数据，且极难事后修复。</p>\n<p><strong>主数据治理</strong>。库位主数据是长期资产，字段变更必须走版本与影响评估：改一个库位的载重上限，会牵动所有基于旧上限的评分与选址。把主数据与配置分离存储（而非硬编码）并保留变更审计，是让 slotting 反复迭代而不每次&quot;推倒重来&quot;的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>WMS 的 slotting 落地靠三层对象：<strong>库位主数据</strong>（慢变量，描述货能放哪）、<strong>任务</strong>（快变量，分钟级生灭）、<strong>指令</strong>（决策函数，把信号映射到具体作业）；三者由库存事务闭合，WMS 拥有库位级实时账，ERP 拥有财务口径汇总账。</li>\n<li>库位编码用&quot;巷道-货架-层-格&quot;四段本地编号，与 GS1 的 GTIN/SSCC（GS1 General Specifications，AI 00/01）是两套体系；主数据必须覆盖结构定位、物理约束、用途属性、状态属性，缺一类定向就退化为随机选位。</li>\n<li>定向上架 = 硬约束过滤候选 + 加权评分排序（流速匹配、行走距离、聚集度、冲突惩罚）+ 派单加软锁；流量超出单库位时按整箱/托盘拆分，并保住同 SKU 聚集。</li>\n<li>任务队列解决排序、分区、交叉，优先级 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>U</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = \\alpha U + \\beta S - \\gamma A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 中等待分量权重过低会让长尾任务饿死；任务交叉的价值在学术与工程上都被反复确认（De Koster 等, EJOR 2007）。</li>\n<li>上架与补货共用队列时，正确性的唯一判据是&quot;源减目标加原子成对、任务状态与占用状态一致&quot;；scan-to-confirm 与可追溯日志是定向上架从更快走向更可信的开关。</li>\n<li>2026 年的架构取向：设备侧 VDA 5050、上游侧 ASN 预生成、事件侧 GS1 EPCIS 2.0、任务与库存事务分离；并发靠库位级软锁加乐观并发控制。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"WMS 库位主数据与任务模型：定向上架指令与任务队列集成","id":"wms-库位主数据与任务模型-定向上架指令与任务队列集成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：库位主数据、任务与指令的三层模型","id":"核心概念-库位主数据-任务与指令的三层模型"},{"level":2,"text":"库位主数据的字段模型与层级","id":"库位主数据的字段模型与层级"},{"level":2,"text":"定向上架指令的生成：从入库单到目标库位","id":"定向上架指令的生成-从入库单到目标库位"},{"level":2,"text":"任务队列：优先级、插单与任务交叉","id":"任务队列-优先级-插单与任务交叉"},{"level":2,"text":"与补货任务的同队列集成","id":"与补货任务的同队列集成"},{"level":2,"text":"工程现实：接口、并发与 2026 年的架构取向","id":"工程现实-接口-并发与-2026-年的架构取向"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"补货异常与缺货处置：短拣、优先级抢占与拥塞治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-slotting-directed-putaway-replenishment/directed-putaway-replenishment/replenishment-exception-stockout-handling"},"next":{"title":"工程化劳力标准与任务分配：标准工时、负载均衡与激励","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-slotting-directed-putaway-replenishment/slotting-ops-labor-wms/engineered-labor-standards-planning"}}